      "Mitigation and adaptation are complements rather than complete substitutes.",
      "Energy reliability and affordability are political constraints, not distractions from climate policy.",
      "Global coordination is difficult because costs are national while benefits are shared.",
      "Technology can change political tradeoffs by reducing the cost of cleaner choices.",
